# secrets.env.tpl.example - the SHAPE of this repo's entries in ~/.config/aycas/secrets.env.tpl, nothing more.
# Added by retrofit-apply on 2026-09-25 (rubric item 7; generated for the other profile; no template stack).
#
# The real template holds only op:// references (zero cleartext). aycas-secrets-sync runs
# `op inject` over it to regenerate ~/.config/aycas/secrets.env, which the shell sources.
# To add a secret for AYCAS Studios Brand Assets: create the item in 1Password (vault Studios-Automation, tag env:prod,
# one CONCEALED field per NAME), add a line like the ones below to the real template, run
# aycas-secrets-sync. Never paste a value anywhere.
#
# No secret names were derivable from the repo. Shape only - replace EXAMPLE_KEY with a real
# name, or delete this file if the repo never needs a secret:
#
# export BRAND_ASSETS_EXAMPLE_KEY={{ op://Studios-Automation/brand-assets/EXAMPLE_KEY }}
